================================================================================
py4DSTEM (conventions)
================================================================================

The apps' lattice convention (a along x, b in the xy plane; reciprocal vectors
without 2 pi; structure factors in A) follows py4DSTEM's Crystal class
(py4DSTEM/process/diffraction/crystal.py). The Lobato & Van Dyck electron
scattering table of slice 2 is py4DSTEM's (commit f050d207,
scattering_factors.txt, sha256 be845d1d..., fetched by
tools/slice-2/fetch-table.sh into the gitignored References/ and pinned bit for
bit), and the ring fit's models follow py4DSTEM's fit_ellipse_1D and
fit_ellipse_amorphous_ring (process/calibration/ellipse.py) through mac4DSTEM's
port.

