Crystal structures named in the tests
================================================================================

beta'' (Mg5Si6): S. J. Andersen, H. W. Zandbergen, J. Jansen, C. Traeholt,
U. Tundal, O. Reiso, Acta Materialia 46(9), 3283-3298 (1998),
doi:10.1016/S1359-6454(97)00493-X; cell from the abstract, coordinates from
